      "Language": "ita",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The auricle arhythmic illness (exhibition of 16 cases with diagnostic, prophilactic and therapeutic considerations). The Authors make a report on sixteen cases seen in the last four years, after distinguishing between the simple kind (which explicates by BS, BSA, AS) and the complex one, in which can be found bradycardy, tachiarithmy, and asystoly. They also stress its meaning compared with other heart illnesses by a statistic point of view. They stress moreover the radiotelemetric monitoring of every suspicious case and the follow-up of the sinus node work by pacing. The treatment of every case with demand pacemakers is recommended."},
